          "content": "B\n\nShe asked you to be honest, and she's about to make a decision that could seriously affect her financial stability. A kind friend protects her from a lie she'd learn the hard way months later, when rent is due and the paintings still haven't sold. The truth, delivered gently, lets her make an informed choice\u2014maybe try selling part-time before giving notice, maybe continue working while building a portfolio. Either way, she deserves the real picture, not a comforting one.",
